---
pagination:
  data: authors.people
  size: 1
  alias: person
permalink: "authors/{{ person.slug }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ person.name }}, {{ person.title }} at Coffee & Fun LLC"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="antialiased" lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />

    <title>{{ person.name }} - Coffee &amp; Fun LLC</title>
    <meta name="title" content="{{ person.name }} - Coffee &amp; Fun LLC" />
    <meta name="description" content="{% if person.bio %}{{ person.bio | escape }}{% else %}{{ person.name }} is {{ person.title }} at Coffee &amp; Fun LLC.{% endif %}" />
    <meta name="author" content="{{ person.name }}" />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />

    <link rel="canonical" href="https://www.coffeeandfun.com/authors/{{ person.slug }}/" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/assets/images/brand/favicon.png" sizes="any" />

    <meta property="og:type" content="profile" />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Coffee &amp; Fun" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="{{ person.name }} - Coffee &amp; Fun LLC" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="{{ person.name }} is {{ person.title }} at Coffee &amp; Fun LLC." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://www.coffeeandfun.com/authors/{{ person.slug }}/" />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://www.coffeeandfun.com{{ person.photo }}" />
    <meta property="og:locale" content="en_US" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="twitter:site" content="@bycoffeeandfun" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="{{ person.name }} - Coffee &amp; Fun LLC" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="{{ person.name }} is {{ person.title }} at Coffee &amp; Fun LLC." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.coffeeandfun.com{{ person.photo }}" />

    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fef5ec" />

    {%- comment -%}
      ProfilePage wrapping a Person, with the Person pointed back at the shared
      Organization graph. mainEntity is what tells a search engine this page is
      ABOUT this person rather than merely mentioning them, which is the whole
      reason these pages help the byline on every article.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "ProfilePage",
        "url": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/authors/{{ person.slug }}/",
        "name": {{ person.name | json }},
        "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/#website" },
        "mainEntity": {
          "@type": "Person",
          {% if person.slug == 'robert-james-gabriel' %}"@id": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/#founder",{% endif %}
          "name": {{ person.name | json }},
          "jobTitle": {{ person.title | json }},
          "url": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/authors/{{ person.slug }}/",
          "image": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com{{ person.photo }}",
          "worksFor": { "@id": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/#organization" }
          {%- if person.sameAs and person.sameAs.size > 0 -%},
          "sameAs": {{ person.sameAs | json }}
          {%- endif %}
        }
      }
    </script>

    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
        "itemListElement": [
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/" },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": "About", "item": "https://www.coffeeandfun.com/about/" },
          { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": {{ person.name | json }} }
        ]
      }
    </script>

    {% include schema-org.liquid %}

    {% bundledCss %}
    {% include sketch-styles.liquid %}
</head>

<body class="brand-color-background">
  {% include header.liquid %}

  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto w-full max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10 sm:py-14">

    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-8 text-sm text-stone-600">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-espresso underline underline-offset-2">Home</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-2">/</span>
      <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-espresso underline underline-offset-2">About</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-2">/</span>
      <span aria-current="page" class="text-stone-800">{{ person.name }}</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="flex flex-col items-center text-center sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:text-left gap-5 sm:gap-7 mb-10">
      <span class="aura aura-lg {{ person.aura }} inline-block shrink-0" style="--aura-radius: 1.5rem;">
        <img
          class="block w-28 h-28 sm:w-32 sm:h-32 object-cover rounded-3xl"
          src="{{ person.photo }}"
          alt="{{ person.alt }}"
          width="420" height="420"
          decoding="async"
        />
      </span>
      <div>
        <h1 class="brand-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl leading-tight mb-1">{{ person.name }}</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-caramel" style="font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;">{{ person.title }} at Coffee &amp; Fun LLC</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    {% if person.bio %}
    <p class="text-stone-700 leading-relaxed mb-10 max-w-2xl">{{ person.bio }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {%- comment -%}
      Posts are matched on the article's own front matter, not on a duplicated
      list, so an author page can never drift from what the articles actually
      say. A post with no `author` key counts as the default author, which is
      how fifty existing posts land here without being edited.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign postCount = 0 -%}
    {%- for item in collections.all -%}
      {%- if item.data.isBlog -%}
        {%- assign itemAuthor = item.data.author | default: authors.default -%}
        {%- if itemAuthor == person.slug -%}{%- assign postCount = postCount | plus: 1 -%}{%- endif -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}

    <section aria-labelledby="articles-heading">
      <h2 id="articles-heading" class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">
        Articles by {{ person.shortName }}
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mb-6">
        {% if postCount == 1 %}1 article{% else %}{{ postCount }} articles{% endif %}
      </p>

      {% if postCount > 0 %}
      <ul class="not-prose flex flex-col gap-4">
        {%- for item in collections.all reversed -%}
          {%- if item.data.isBlog -%}
            {%- assign itemAuthor = item.data.author | default: authors.default -%}
            {%- if itemAuthor == person.slug -%}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="block rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white/70 p-5 transition hover:border-mocha focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-espresso focus-visible:ring-offset-2">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-stone-900 mb-1">{{ item.data.cardTitle | default: item.data.title }}</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-stone-600 mb-2">{{ item.data.description }}</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-stone-500">
              <time datetime="{{ item.data.date | date: '%Y-%m-%d' }}">{{ item.data.date | formatDateWithOrdinal }}</time>
              {% if item.data.time %}<span aria-hidden="true"> &middot; </span>{{ item.data.time }} read{% endif %}
            </p>
          </a>
        </li>
            {%- endif -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
      {% else %}
      <p class="text-stone-600">{{ person.shortName }} has not published an article yet.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </section>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm">
      <a href="/authors/" class="text-caramel underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-espresso">All authors</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="mx-2 text-stone-400">&middot;</span>
      <a href="/about/" class="text-caramel underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-espresso">Meet the rest of the team</a>
    </p>

  </main>

  {% include modals.liquid %}
  {% include footer.liquid %}
</body>
</html>
